ki, <code>electronics</code> ve <code>stationery</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Yok</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Dört, <code>electronics</code> iki kez ve <code>stationery</code> iki kez</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">İki, <code>electronics</code> ve <code>stationery</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
