            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bu sorgudaki grupları filtrelemek için hangi sütunları kullanabiliriz?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"sql\" name=\"script.sql\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"SELECT\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"category\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"COUNT\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(*)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"FROM\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" wishlist\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"WHERE\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"category\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"LIKE\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"'s%'\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"GROUP\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"BY\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"category\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\";\" /></content><output><table name=\"Result\"><row><data content=\"No result!\" /></row></table></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>category</code> veya <code>COUNT(*)</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Yalnızca <code>COUNT(*)</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Yalnızca <code>category</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>category</code> veya <code>COUNT(*)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir <code>HAVING</code> yan tümcesi bu sorgunun oluşturduğu grupları filtreleyecek. Hangi çift iki geçerli koşul içerir?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"sql\" name=\"script.sql\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"SELECT\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"category\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"COUNT\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(*)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"FROM\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" wishlist\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"WHERE\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"category\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"LIKE\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"'s%'\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"GROUP\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"BY\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"category\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\";\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>category LIKE 's%'</code> veya <code>COUNT(*) &gt; 2</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Yalnızca <code>COUNT(*) &gt; 2</code>, çünkü <code>HAVING</code> yalnızca toplama fonksiyonlarını kabul eder</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Yalnızca <code>category LIKE 's%'</code>, çünkü toplama sonuçları filtrelenemez</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>wishlist</code> veya <code>category</code>, çünkü ikisi de <code>GROUP BY</code> öncesinde görünür</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>category LIKE 's%'</code> veya <code>COUNT(*) &gt; 2</code>.</p></body></html>"
